{"id":"e030c919dd34652e","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-cat-b-limits.md","title":"prop-cat-b-limits","display":"prop-cat-b-limits","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-prop-cat-b-limits","aliases":["16-prop-cat-b-limits","16-pro--cat-b-limits"],"display":"prop-cat-b-limits","depends_on":["[[16-df-internal-category]]","[[16-df-internal-functor]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Proposition 7.2.2 and proof, pp. 416–417 (PDF 436–437)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-cat-b-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-cat-b-limits</span><span>16-pro--cat-b-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cat-b-limits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64d6f11083f002d7\" href=\"?note=64d6f11083f002d7\" title=\"16-df-internal-functor\">16-df-internal-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 7.2.2 and proof, pp. 416–417 (PDF 436–437)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是足够大宇宙中的小范畴，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</li>\n<li>内部范畴候选记录采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a>，内部函子谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64d6f11083f002d7\" href=\"?note=64d6f11083f002d7\" title=\"16-df-internal-functor\">16-df-internal-functor</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\">\\(F=(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(G_0,G_1):D\\to E\">\\(G=(G_0,G_1):D\\to E\\)</span> 表示满足该谓词的记录。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cat}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{cat}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 是下列同一六元组构造的两种字体记号；此处只含内部函子作为箭头，不把内部自然变换混入普通范畴的箭头集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{s,t}\">\\(P_{s,t}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a> 固定的同一可复合对拉回；候选内部范畴记录的各分量域在下式列出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"64d6f11083f002d7\" href=\"?note=64d6f11083f002d7\" title=\"16-df-internal-functor\">16-df-internal-functor</a> 的精确签名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m\\rangle\\mid C_0,C_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land s,t\\in\\mathcal B(C_1,C_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e\\in\\mathcal B(C_0,C_1)\\land m\\in\\mathcal B(P_{s,t},C_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,D,F\\rangle\\mid C,D\\in O\\land F=(F_0,F_1)\n\\land(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle C,D,F\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq C,\n\\qquad t\\langle C,D,F\\rangle\\coloneqq D,\\\\\ne(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,C,(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1})\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle D,E,G\\rangle,\\langle C,D,F\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle C,E,(G_0F_0,G_1F_1)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cat}(\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m\\rangle\\mid C_0,C_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land s,t\\in\\mathcal B(C_1,C_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e\\in\\mathcal B(C_0,C_1)\\land m\\in\\mathcal B(P_{s,t},C_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,D,F\\rangle\\mid C,D\\in O\\land F=(F_0,F_1)\n\\land(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle C,D,F\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq C,\n\\qquad t\\langle C,D,F\\rangle\\coloneqq D,\\\\\ne(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,C,(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1})\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle D,E,G\\rangle,\\langle C,D,F\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle C,E,(G_0F_0,G_1F_1)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cat}(\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\operatorname{Cat}(\\mathcal B)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>恒等和复合逐分量保持内部范畴的四个结构图，故箭头运算封闭，范畴公理由基范畴逐分量继承。</li>\n<li>终内部范畴取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,1)\">\\((1,1)\\)</span> 及唯一结构箭头；二元积的对象对象和箭头对象分别取基范畴的积。两内部函子的等化子在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0,C_1\">\\(C_0,C_1\\)</span> 上分别取等化子；结构箭头由源靶、单位和复合的交换图唯一限制到这些子对象上。基范畴的泛性质逐分量给出内部函子的泛性质，故具有终对象、二元积、等化子，从而全部有限极限。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Proposition 7.2.2 and proof, pp. 416–417（PDF 436–437）。本页只断言原书的有限极限部分；CCC 的附加结论未列入当前命题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-functor","status":"resolved","id":"64d6f11083f002d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":fals